apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Başlıklar: apns-topic: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: uyarı, apns-collapse-id: oda:42
Gövde: {aps: {alert: {title, body}}, data: <sealed>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Para yatırma: POST /bmp/deposit {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Alma: GET /bmp/messages (yetkilendirildi)

